Instrument the current \(td=7\) adjudicator to emit, for every route, a provenance record

\[
(\text{vertex type},\nu,\epsilon,l,(m_j),\bar\kappa,X,
\text{gap},\text{eventual fibre multiplicity},\text{charged summand}).
