quotient (uW_i = W_i^-1); G3 term-count/degree cap 150k; G4 shape
reconciliation vs Sol (29v/32eq/12,654t, six rows 1218x5+1216) +
cross-prime support equality; G5 emission hygiene per AUDIT.md.
"""
