+| Representative radical fiber at D23 | D21 is a 13-fold; after exact quotienting, D23 imposes only three independent base obstructions and leaves five irrelevant auxiliary directions. | Conditional on decision: **80–90% NONEMPTY** (point estimate **85%**), **10–20% `[1]`**. |
+| Sparse quotient solve | The exact `p=105337` quotient target is now 22v/29eq/5,378 terms.  Cross-prime and provenance emissions remain to be banked. | Terminal basis: about **70% within 1 h**, **85–90% within 12 h**. |
